ROUGHNESS EVALUATION
As previously discussed, CT scan data was used as a nondestructive determination for internal surface roughness. The arithmetic mean roughness (Ra) was calculated using the axial slices from CT scan data. Ra reflects the average surface deviation from a mean reference and its mathematical definition is given in equation (2).
